Daídalos is an amateur project developped in C++,
it use OpenGL as displaying library, SDL as
windowing library and SDL Mixer as sound library.
It's developped by myself during my spare time.

The project is currently under development, 
since July 2008.
Don't hesitate to give your opinion on the
project at the address:
http://www.stephane-baudoux.com
